{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01J5i2hRnCysRWuQzdZxaSuD","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /var/folders/XX/XXXX/T/skilleval-golden-06-1-uyvk34oj/.eval-home/.claude/projects/-private-var-folders-g9--dhv-jzj5ljd5nywv14y31hm0000gn-T-skilleval-golden-06-1-uyvk34oj/memory/feedback_bun_native_addons.md"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"REDACTED","uuid":"fcae8dd5-4810-47e8-a101-210aef7ef4f2","timestamp":"2026-07-29T04:54:22.031Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"create","filePath":"/var/folders/XX/XXXX/T/skilleval-golden-06-1-uyvk34oj/.eval-home/.claude/projects/-private-var-folders-g9--dhv-jzj5ljd5nywv14y31hm0000gn-T-skilleval-golden-06-1-uyvk34oj/memory/feedback_bun_native_addons.md","content":"---\nname: bun-native-addon-fix\ndescription: \"Fix \\\"Could not resolve\\\" errors for native addons when using bun build --compile\"\nmetadata: \n  node_type: memory\n  type: feedback\n  originSessionId: REDACTED\n  modified: 2026-07-29T04:54:22.029Z\n---\n\nWhen `bun build --compile` fails with \"Could not resolve\" for a native addon (e.g., `@libsql/client`):\n1. Locate the static import in the source file\n2. Replace it with a dynamic import at call time (e.g., in the function that uses it)\n\n**Why:** `bun build --compile` cannot embed native addons; static imports fail the build, but dynamic imports defer resolution until runtime when the addon is available.\n\n**How to apply:** When you see a \"Could not resolve\" error for a package with a native component, try swapping from static `import` to dynamic `import()`.\n\nExample:\n```typescript\n// Before (fails)\nimport { createClient } from \"@libsql/client\";\n\n// After (works)\nasync function initClient() {\n  const { createClient } = await import(\"@libsql/client\");\n  return createClient(...);\n}\n```\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false,"memdirStamped":true}}
